### ===================================
### Order Processing Platform - API Demo
### ===================================
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension
### or IntelliJ HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### ===================================
### Health Checks
### ===================================

### 1. API Gateway Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. API Gateway Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### ===================================
### Authentication
### ===================================

### 3. Register New User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### 4. Login (Get JWT Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Save token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ===================================
### User Operations
### ===================================

### 5. Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Update User Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Johnny",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### ===================================
### Product Catalog
### ===================================

### 7. Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Products by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/category/1
Accept: application/json

### 10. Search Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?name=laptop&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Products In Stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/in-stock
Accept: application/json

### ===================================
### Order Operations
### ===================================

### 12. Create New Order
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PROD-001",
      "productName": "MacBook Pro 16",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 2499.99
    },
    {
      "productId": "PROD-002",
      "productName": "Magic Mouse",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 99.99
    }
  ]
}

### Save order ID
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### 13. Get Order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get User Orders (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?userId=1&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Update Order Status (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status?status=RESERVED&reason=Inventory%20reserved
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 16. Cancel Order
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}?reason=Customer%20request
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ===================================
### Inventory Operations
### ===================================

### 17. Get Inventory for Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/PROD-001
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 18. Update Inventory (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/PROD-001
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "totalQuantity": 100,
  "reservedQuantity": 0
}

### ===================================
### Admin Operations (ROLE_ADMIN required)
### ===================================

### 19. Create Product (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 Pro",
  "description": "Latest Apple smartphone with A17 Pro chip",
  "price": 1199.99,
  "stock": 50,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "active": true
}

### 20. Update Product (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 Pro Max",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 45,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "active": true
}

### 21. Delete Product (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/99
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 22. Get All Users (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ===================================
### Kafka Event Testing
### ===================================

### After creating an order, check Kafka UI at:
### http://localhost:8088
### 
### Expected topics:
### - order.created
### - order.status-changed
### - inventory.reserved
### - notification.send

### ===================================
### Swagger UI
### ===================================

### Open in browser:
### http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### ===================================
### Actuator Endpoints
### ===================================

### 23. Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

### 24. Application Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### 25. Environment (if exposed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/env
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

